            <h1>The 5 API Patterns Every Automation Engineer Needs to Know</h1>
            <p class="lead">
                Most automation scripts fail not because the code is wrong, but because the architecture is fragile. Here are the five API patterns that separate working systems from broken ones — and how to choose the right pattern for your data flow.
            </p>
        </header>

        <div class="toc">
